// ms2_ue.cpp -- see ms2_ue.h for the contract.
//
// HOUSE RULES, all load-bearing:
//
//  1. Every read of game memory goes through ReadMem/WriteMem.  Those are the
//     ONLY functions containing __try, and they are POD-only, because MSVC
//     refuses __try in a function that needs object unwinding (C2712).  A wrong
//     offset therefore returns false and logs; it cannot fault the game.
//  2. Nothing runs at DllMain time.  Init() is called from the module's worker
//     thread after the loader has finished with us.
//  3. A global is used only after being PROVEN readable: the object array is
//     validated by walking it and checking that every FUObjectItem's object
//     reports the internal index the array claims for it.
//  4. Nothing on the ProcessEvent hot path resolves a string.  The detour does
//     integer FName compares and a mutex test; names are resolved only when
//     something asks for one.
